            "review_title": "Review at Ca Phe Co Ba Dong Khoi Rooftop",
            "review_text": "Yan Cui Travel\n253 contributions\n0\nVintage 80s style cafe with Saigon River view\nDec 2021 • Friends\nWe would like to give a thumbs up for the mixed fresh juices (which we ordered with no sugar) and all tasted good for us. The outdoor ambience decorated with many green plants looks friendly and breathable. Seating on the 5th floor can bring a direct view towards Saigon River and the downtown. The desserts (strawberry cake, passion fruit cake and red velvet) were sweeter than we expected so we didn’t really like much. If we come back here next time, we would take a try with some food and cockfails.\nRead more\nWritten December 29, 2021",
